      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\t     Game 1\r\nThe player needs to collect rewards for which he receives
    points, and also avoid obstacles on the way.\r\n\nCharacter Control:\r\n    
    Swipe right - tackle,\r\n     Swipe down - quick descent after a jump,\r\n    
    Tap on the screen - jump.\r\n\n\n\t     Game 2\r\nThe player needs to click on
    the place where the target appears in time. For a successful click, the character
    receives points."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1858def7c20f1e42a1f9632c4e4e327, type: 2}
